<title>USA: Suburban Propane president resigned.</title>
<headline>Suburban Propane president resigned.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY, N.J. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suburban Propane Partners L.P. said Thursday that Salvatore Quadrino resigned as president to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Mark Alexander, Suburban's chief executive, will assume the additional title of president.</p>
<p>In connection with Quadrino's departure, David Feheley, senior vice president of operations, and Thomas Nunan, vice president of sales, will assume added responsibilities, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
